<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00510/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一瓶约为550ml的以聚酯（PET）为原料，添加了相应的有机溶剂后，经过高温加热后，通过塑料模具经过吹塑、挤吹、或者注塑成型的塑料容器包装饮用水.饮用后会导致瘀血阻滞，脾肾阳气不足及口中干燥。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>████超市<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>Daniel Researcher 办公室中的垃圾桶内<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>什么矿泉水怎么喝完更渴了？</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00510" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00510" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00510-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/daniel-researcher" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6980732); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6980732&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609573601" alt="Daniel Researcher" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6980732)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/daniel-researcher" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6980732); return false;">Daniel Researcher</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1609564501 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">02 Jan 2021 05:15</span></p>
</div>
